      "solution": "Đồ thị <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> có tiệm cận đứng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và tiệm cận ngang <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, giao điểm hai tiệm cận là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tDiện tích hình vuông <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tGọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>25</mn><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (đẳng thức xảy ra khi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>).<br>\n\t\tVậy diện tích nhỏ nhất của hình vuông <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></semantics></math> bằng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
